TITLE pe after equilibration with fixed-pressure gas using EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES fugacities
SOLUTION 1
    temp 150
    pH 7 charge
    pe 4
    units kgw
    water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    CO2(g) -0.39794 10
    CH4(g) -0.39794 10
    NH3(g) -0.69897 5
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.txt
    -reset false
    -pH true
    -pe true
END
